b:["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-[15px]","children":[["$","li","Identity and account information, including name, registration or employee identifier, institutional or registered email address, role, program, batch, session, and account status.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Identity and account information, including name, registration or employee identifier, institutional or registered email address, role, program, batch, session, and account status."}]]}],["$","li","Academic and operational information, including courses, schedules, attendance, leave, assessments, marks, results, course plans, examination papers, QEC evidence, and class-related requests.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Academic and operational information, including courses, schedules, attendance, leave, assessments, marks, results, course plans, examination papers, QEC evidence, and class-related requests."}]]}],["$","li","Communications and files submitted through queries, course chats, assignments, quizzes, lectures, outlines, support requests, and other authorized portal workflows.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Communications and files submitted through queries, course chats, assignments, quizzes, lectures, outlines, support requests, and other authorized portal workflows."}]]}],["$","li","Security and technical information needed to operate the portal, such as session data, access events, error information, rate-limit activity, and service-health measurements.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6