te service updates, and protect the integrity of institutional processes."}]]}],["$","li","EIMS LMS may exchange authorized student and academic information with the Institute's Master Database. Master Database records remain authoritative where a workflow identifies them as the source of truth.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"EIMS LMS may exchange authorized student and academic information with the Institute's Master Database. Master Database records remain authoritative where a workflow identifies them as the source of truth."}]]}]]}]]}]
