":"Information may be shared with authorized Institute departments, approved service providers, or legal and regulatory authorities where required for institutional operations, compliance, security, or the protection of users."}]]}],["$","li","EIMS LMS does not treat student records, credentials, private messages, submissions, or protected uploads as public information.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"EIMS LMS does not treat student records, credentials, private messages, submissions, or protected uploads as public information."}]]}]]}]]}]
