e content, or information unrelated to an authorized Institute activity.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Reasonable administrative, technical, access-control, backup, monitoring, and recovery safeguards are used. No online system can promise absolute security, and users must not upload malware, executable content, or information unrelated to an authorized Institute activity."}]]}],["$","li","Backups and restore points may contain the same institutional records as the live system and are protected for recovery and continuity purposes.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Backups and restore points may contain the same institutional records as the live system and are protected for recovery and continuity purposes."}]]}]]}]]}]
10:["$","article","Retention, corrections, and deletion",{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm sm:p-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-100 pb-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-red-50 text-[#6D0303]","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":22,"height":22,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-scale","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","108xh3",{"d":"M12 3v18"}],["$","path","zcdpyk",{"d":"m19 8 3 8a5 5 0 0 1-6 0zV7"}],["$","path","1yorad",{"d":"M3 7h1a17 17 0 0 0 8-2 17 17 0 0 0 8 2h1"}],["$","path","eua70x",{"d":"m5 8 3 8a5 5 0 0 1-6 0zV7"}],["$","path","1b0cd5",{"d":"M7 21h10"}],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900","children":"Retention, corrections, and deletion"}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-[15px]","children":[["$","li","Academic, examination, attendance, QEC, communication, audit, and administrative records are retained according to Institute requirements and operational necessity.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Academic, examination, attendance, QEC, communication, audit, and administrative records are retained according to Institute requirements and operational necessity."}]]}],["$","li","Where a person leaves the Institute or no longer needs access, the account may be deactivated while linked academic history is preserved. Records with attendance, marks, schedules, submissions, papers, or other dependencies may not be permanently deleted merely by deleting an account.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Where a person leaves the Institute or no longer needs access, the account may be deactivated while linked academic history is preserved. Records with attendance, marks, schedules, submissions, papers, or other dependencies may not be permanently deleted merely by deleting an account."}]]}],["$","li","Users may request correction of inaccurate profile or academic information through the responsible department. Identity or course data owned by the Master Database must be corrected at its authoritative source.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Users may request correction of inaccurate profile or academic information through the responsible department. Identity or course data owned by the Master Database must be corrected at its authoritative source."}]]}]]}]]}]
