utomate abusive requests, or upload prohibited material."}]]}],["$","li","Attendance, results, examination papers, QEC evidence, and official communications must be accurate and must not be altered outside their approved workflows. Misuse may result in access restriction and action under Institute policy.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Attendance, results, examination papers, QEC evidence, and official communications must be accurate and must not be altered outside their approved workflows. Misuse may result in access restriction and action under Institute policy."}]]}]]}]]}]
12:["$","section",null,{"id":"academic-policies","className":"mt-12 scroll-mt-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-5 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-[#6D0303] to-[#990b0b] p-6 text-white shadow-sm sm:p-8","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-red-100","children":"Functional academic policies"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl","children":"Attendance, leave, holidays and class operations"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 max-w-4xl text-sm leading-6 text-red-50 sm:text-base","children":"The following rules describe how EIMS LMS currently processes attendance, automatic absence, student leave, teacher leave, academic closures, cancellations, make-up classes, assessments, results, queries, and merged schedules."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2","children":[["$","article","Student attendance policy",{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm sm:p-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-100 pb-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-red-50 text-[#6D0303]","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":22,"height":22,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-clipboard-check","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","rect","tgr4d6",{"width":"8","height":"4","x":"8","y":"2","rx":"1","ry":"1"}],["$","path","116196",{"d":"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"}],["$","path","df797q",{"d":"m9 14 2 2 4-4"}],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900","children":"Student attendance policy"}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-[15px]","children":[["$","li","Attendance is taken against an active LMS schedule and its exact course, teacher, program, semester or batch, session, class date, and merged-class membership. Only students returned as Active by the authoritative roster are eligible to appear.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Attendance is taken against an active LMS schedule and its exact course, teacher, program, semester or batch, session, class date, and merged-class membership. Only students returned as Active by the authoritative roster are eligible to appear."}]]}],["$","li","The standard attendance window opens at the scheduled class start time and remains open for six hours. A visible countdown informs the teacher when attendance opens or closes; the active system configuration remains authoritative if the Institute changes this period.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"The standard attendance window opens at the scheduled class start time and remains open for six hours. A visible countdown informs the teacher when attendance opens or closes; the active system configuration remains authoritative if the Institute changes this period."}]]}],["$","li","Present, Absent, and approved Leave records are included in course attendance reporting. Absence records, including valid system-generated absences, affect the student's course attendance percentage.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Present, Absent, and approved Leave records are included in course attendance reporting. Absence records, including valid system-generated absences, affect the student's course attendance percentage."}]]}],"$L19"]}]]}],"$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22"]}]]}]
13:["$","section",null,{"id":"policy-faq","className":"mt-12 scroll-mt-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-5 flex items-center gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-red-50 text-[#6D0303]","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":23,"height":23,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-users-round","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","3ypg7q",{"d":"M18 21a8 8 0 0 0-16 0"}],["$","circle","o932ke",{"cx":"10","cy":"8","r":"5"}],["$","path","10s06x",{"d":"M22 20c0-3.37-2-6.5-4-8a5 5 0 0 0-.45-8.3"}],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#6D0303]","children":"Quick answers"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950","children":"Frequently asked policy questions"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","details","When does EIMS LMS automatically mark a student absent?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm open:border-red-200","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer list-none pr-6 font-bold text-slate-900 marker:hidden","children":"When does EIMS LMS automatically mark a student absent?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-[15px]","children":"For an eligible active scheduled class, unmarked Active students may be marked Absent after the configured attendance window closes. The current standard window is six hours from class start, and the background process rechecks a rolling seven-day period."}]]}],["$","details","Does EIMS LMS mark attendance on a holiday or academic off-day?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm open:border-red-200","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer list-none pr-6 font-bold text-slate-900 marker:hidden","children":"Does EIMS LMS mark attendance on a holiday or academic off-day?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-[15px]","children":"No. An active Holiday or Off Day that applies to the Institute, program, or session suppresses attendance and automatic absence for the affected class."}]]}],["$","details","Does submitting student leave immediately change attendance?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm open:border-red-200","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer list-none pr-6 font-bold text-slate-900 marker:hidden","children":"Does submitting student leave immediately change attendance?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-[15px]","children":"No. Student-submitted leave stays Requested until Management or Admin approves it. After approval, matching absence records can be changed to Leave for the approved date range."}]]}],["$","details","Does teacher leave automatically cancel every class?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm open:border-red-200","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer list-none pr-6 font-bold text-slate-900 marker:hidden","children":"Does teacher leave automatically cancel every class?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-[15px]","children":"No. The affected schedules must be formally cancelled, reassigned, marked off, or supported through approved make-up classes. This is especially important for merged classes covering multiple programs or batches."}]]}]]}]]}]
14:["$","section",null,{"id":"policy-support","className":"mt-12 scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm sm:p-7","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-col gap-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-2 text-[#6D0303]","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":22,"height":22,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-headset","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","12oyoe",{"d":"M3 11h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-5Zm0 0a9 9 0 1 1 18 0m0 0v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-1a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3Z"}],["$","path","1x7m43",{"d":"M21 16v2a4 4 0 0 1-4 4h-5"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold","children":"Questions, corrections, or security concerns"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-[15px]","children":"Contact the relevant Institute department for academic corrections. For account access, privacy, file-access, or security concerns, create an IT Support query. Do not include passwords in any query or attachment."}]]}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/it-support","className":"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-[#6D0303] px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-sm transition hover:bg-[#520202]","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":18,"height":18,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-headset","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","12oyoe",{"d":"M3 11h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-5Zm0 0a9 9 0 1 1 18 0m0 0v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-1a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3Z"}],["$","path","1x7m43",{"d":"M21 16v2a4 4 0 0 1-4 4h-5"}],"$undefined"]}],"Contact IT Support"]}]]}]}]
