19:["$","li","Attendance must be accurate and submitted through the authorized teacher workflow. Students should report a suspected discrepancy through their portal query system or the responsible academic department.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Attendance must be accurate and submitted through the authorized teacher workflow. Students should report a suspected discrepancy through their portal query system or the responsible academic department."}]]}]
1a:["$","article","Automatic absence and attendance recovery policy",{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm sm:p-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-100 pb-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-red-50 text-[#6D0303]","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":22,"height":22,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-calendar-clock","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","fo4ql5",{"d":"M16 14v2.2l1.6 1"}],["$","path","4m81vk",{"d":"M16 2v4"}],["$","path","1osxxc",{"d":"M21 7.5V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h3.5"}],["$","path","r794hk",{"d":"M3 10h5"}],["$","path","1cmpym",{"d":"M8 2v4"}],["$","circle","qoo3c4",{"cx":"16","cy":"16","r":"6"}],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900","children":"Automatic absence and attendance recovery policy"}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-[15px]","children":[["$","li","After the attendance window closes, the scheduled background attendance service may mark every still-unmarked Active student Absent. An approved leave applicable to that student and date is recorded as Leave instead.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"After the attendance window closes, the scheduled background attendance service may mark every still-unmarked Active student Absent. An approved leave applicable to that student and date is recorded as Leave instead."}]]}],["$","li","The automatic process reviews a rolling seven-day period so a temporary cron, network, or Master Database interruption can be recovered on a later run. Existing valid attendance is not intentionally duplicated.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"The automatic process reviews a rolling seven-day period so a temporary cron, network, or Master Database interruption can be recovered on a later run. Existing valid attendance is not intentionally duplicated."}]]}],["$","li","Previous attendance cannot be freely edited. An Admin must open a dated historical-attendance recovery window, after which the teacher may create or correct attendance only when the schedule, weekday, academic calendar, cancellation, session, and roster checks succeed.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Previous attendance cannot be freely edited. An Admin must open a dated historical-attendance recovery window, after which the teacher may create or correct attendance only when the schedule, weekday, academic calendar, cancellation, session, and roster checks succeed."}]]}],["$","li","A holiday, academic off-day, or approved cancellation prevents automatic absence for the affected class. If an automatic absence was created before the closure was recorded, the reconciliation workflow removes the system-generated record where applicable.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"A holiday, academic off-day, or approved cancellation prevents automatic absence for the affected class. If an automatic absence was created before the closure was recorded, the reconciliation workflow removes the system-generated record where applicable."}]]}]]}]]}]
1b:["$","article","Academic off-day and holiday policy",{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm sm:p-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-100 pb-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-red-50 text-[#6D0303]","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":22,"height":22,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-calendar-off","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","16swn3",{"d":"M4.2 4.2A2 2 0 0 0 3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 1.82-1.18"}],["$","path","yhw86o",{"d":"M21 15.5V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H9.5"}],["$","path","4m81vk",{"d":"M16 2v4"}],["$","path","1wap6i",{"d":"M3 10h7"}],["$","path","quycpq",{"d":"M21 10h-5.5"}],["$","path","1ooewy",{"d":"m2 2 20 20"}],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900","children":"Academic off-day and holiday policy"}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-[15px]","children":[["$","li","Admin or Management may mark a date as a Holiday or Off Day with a title, description, and Institute, Program, or Session scope. The most specific applicable closure is used for the affected schedule.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Admin or Management may mark a date as a Holiday or Off Day with a title, description, and Institute, Program, or Session scope. The most specific applicable closure is used for the affected schedule."}]]}],["$","li","Affected student and teacher schedules display the closure, attendance is not opened for that class, and the automatic attendance service does not mark students absent.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Affected student and teacher schedules display the closure, attendance is not opened for that class, and the automatic attendance service does not mark students absent."}]]}],["$","li","An approved make-up class that conflicts with a proposed holiday or off-day must first be cancelled or resolved. Deactivating an academic-calendar entry restores normal scheduling rules for future processing but does not authorize arbitrary historical attendance changes.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"An approved make-up class that conflicts with a proposed holiday or off-day must first be cancelled or resolved. Deactivating an academic-calendar entry restores normal scheduling rules for future processing but does not authorize arbitrary historical attendance changes."}]]}]]}]]}]
1c:["$","article","Student leave request policy",{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm sm:p-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-100 pb-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-red-50 text-[#6D0303]","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":22,"height":22,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-user-round-check","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","bjp14o",{"d":"M2 21a8 8 0 0 1 13.292-6"}],["$","circle","o932ke",{"cx":"10","cy":"8","r":"5"}],["$","path","1b14m6",{"d":"m16 19 2 2 4-4"}],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900","children":"Student leave request policy"}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-[15px]","children":[["$","li","A registered student may submit Medical, Personal, Official, or Other leave with a valid start date, end date, and reason. Overlapping Requested or Approved leave is blocked to prevent duplicate records.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"A registered student may submit Medical, Personal, Official, or Other leave with a valid start date, end date, and reason. Overlapping Requested or Approved leave is blocked to prevent duplicate records."}]]}],["$","li","A student request remains Requested until Management or Admin approves or rejects it. The student may withdraw only their own pending request; approval is never assumed merely because a request was submitted.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"A student request remains Requested until Management or Admin approves or rejects it. The student may withdraw only their own pending request; approval is never assumed merely because a request was submitted."}]]}],["$","li","Approved leave updates matching existing Absent attendance to Leave and applies to automatic attendance created within the approved inclusive date range. Approved Leave remains part of the attendance record but is displayed separately from Present or Absent.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Approved leave updates matching existing Absent attendance to Leave and applies to automatic attendance created within the approved inclusive date range. Approved Leave remains part of the attendance record but is displayed separately from Present or Absent."}]]}],["$","li","Management or Admin may revoke approved leave with an audit note. Linked Leave attendance is then restored to Absent where the system recorded it from that leave approval.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Management or Admin may revoke approved leave with an audit note. Linked Leave attendance is then restored to Absent where the system recorded it from that leave approval."}]]}]]}]]}]
1d:["$","article","Teacher leave and class-continuity policy",{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm sm:p-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-100 pb-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-red-50 text-[#6D0303]","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":22,"height":22,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-user-round-minus","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","bjp14o",{"d":"M2 21a8 8 0 0 1 13.292-6"}],["$","circle","o932ke",{"cx":"10","cy":"8","r":"5"}],["$","path","vcuq98",{"d":"M22 19h-6"}],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900","children":"Teacher leave and class-continuity policy"}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-[15px]","children":[["$","li","A Teacher, Management, Admissions, Accounts, Examination, IT, or QEC portal user whose account is linked to an active employee attendance profile may submit Medical, Casual, Official, Emergency, or Other leave to Admin. A submitted request remains Requested until Admin approves or rejects it.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"A Teacher, Management, Admissions, Accounts, Examination, IT, or QEC portal user whose account is linked to an active employee attendance profile may submit Medical, Casual, Official, Emergency, or Other leave to Admin. A submitted request remains Requested until Admin approves or rejects it."}]]}],["$","li","Admin may also record approved leave directly for an employee who has no portal account. Overlapping Requested or Approved employee leave is blocked, and the employee may withdraw only their own pending request.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Admin may also record approved leave directly for an employee who has no portal account. Overlapping Requested or Approved employee leave is blocked, and the employee may withdraw only their own pending request."}]]}],["$","li","Approved employee leave is recorded as Leave for applicable working dates. Biometric imports and attendance calculations do not mark the employee Absent during the approved range, while Institute holidays and the employee's configured official off-days retain their own status.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Approved employee leave is recorded as Leave for applicable working dates. Biometric imports and attendance calculations do not mark the employee Absent during the approved range, while Institute holidays and the employee's configured official off-days retain their own status."}]]}],["$","li","Admin may revoke approved employee leave with an audit note. Attendance days created by the leave are restored to their earlier state or returned to normal biometric recalculation.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Admin may revoke approved employee leave with an audit note. Attendance days created by the leave are restored to their earlier state or returned to normal biometric recalculation."}]]}],["$","li","Teacher leave does not automatically cancel a scheduled class. Until the affected class is formally cancelled, reassigned, marked off, or replaced by an approved make-up class, the original schedule and student-attendance responsibilities remain active.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":["$L23","$L24"]}],"$L25","$L26"]}]]}]
1e:["$","article","Class cancellation and make-up class policy",{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm sm:p-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-100 pb-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-red-50 text-[#6D0303]","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":22,"height":22,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-calendar-check2 lucide-calendar-check-2","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","1cmpym",{"d":"M8 2v4"}],["$","path","4m81vk",{"d":"M16 2v4"}],["$","path","bce9hv",{"d":"M21 14V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h8"}],["$","path","8toen8",{"d":"M3 10h18"}],["$","path","13tcca",{"d":"m16 20 2 2 4-4"}],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900","children":"Class cancellation and make-up class policy"}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-[15px]","children":[["$","li","Teachers may request cancellation only for their own active course and session on a current or future date that matches the scheduled weekday. Management or Admin approval is required before the cancellation becomes effective.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Teachers may request cancellation only for their own active course and session on a current or future date that matches the scheduled weekday. Management or Admin approval is required before the cancellation becomes effective."}]]}],["$","li","A class cannot be approved as cancelled after manual attendance has already been submitted. Approved cancellation suppresses automatic absence and is shown to affected teachers and students.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"A class cannot be approved as cancelled after manual attendance has already been submitted. Approved cancellation suppresses automatic absence and is shown to affected teachers and students."}]]}],["$","li","A make-up class requires a valid date, time, room, reason, active schedule, and conflict-free teacher, room, batch, holiday, and cancellation checks. Teacher requests require approval; Management or Admin may create an approved make-up class directly.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"A make-up class requires a valid date, time, room, reason, active schedule, and conflict-free teacher, room, batch, holiday, and cancellation checks. Teacher requests require approval; Management or Admin may create an approved make-up class directly."}]]}],["$","li","Cancellation and make-up requests are grouped across all matching merged schedules for the selected course and session, ensuring every linked program, semester, batch, and student receives the approved outcome.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Cancellation and make-up requests are grouped across all matching merged schedules for the selected course and session, ensuring every linked program, semester, batch, and student receives the approved outcome."}]]}]]}]]}]
1f:["$","article","Assessment, examination, result and QEC policy",{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm sm:p-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-100 pb-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-red-50 text-[#6D0303]","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":22,"height":22,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-graduation-cap","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","j76jl0",{"d":"M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z"}],["$","path","1lu8f3",{"d":"M22 10v6"}],["$","path","1r8lef",{"d":"M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5"}],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900","children":"Assessment, examination, result and QEC policy"}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-[15px]","children":[["$","li","Assignments, quizzes, lectures, outlines, course plans, examination papers, results, and QEC evidence may be created only through authorized role and course-allocation workflows. Uploaded content remains subject to ownership, file-security, and access checks.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Assignments, quizzes, lectures, outlines, course plans, examination papers, results, and QEC evidence may be created only through authorized role and course-allocation workflows. Uploaded content remains subject to ownership, file-security, and access checks."}]]}],["$","li","Teachers may create examination papers only for allotted active courses and sessions. Submitted papers are locked unless Examination or Admin grants editing access, and required examination controls apply before printing or download.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Teachers may create examination papers only for allotted active courses and sessions. Submitted papers are locked unless Examination or Admin grants editing access, and required examination controls apply before printing or download."}]]}],["$","li","Result publication is controlled by Examination or Admin. A held result remains unavailable when other results are published, and publication windows or selected-semester controls determine what a student can view.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Result publication is controlled by Examination or Admin. A held result remains unavailable when other results are published, and publication windows or selected-semester controls determine what a student can view."}]]}],["$","li","Marks, attendance, submissions, examination papers, QEC evidence, and completed schedules are institutional history. Corrections must use the relevant approved workflow rather than deletion or unauthorized direct alteration.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Marks, attendance, submissions, examination papers, QEC evidence, and completed schedules are institutional history. Corrections must use the relevant approved workflow rather than deletion or unauthorized direct alteration."}]]}]]}]]}]
20:["$","article","Lecture material and academic file policy",{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm sm:p-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-100 pb-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-red-50 text-[#6D0303]","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":22,"height":22,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-file-up","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","1oefj6",{"d":"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"}],["$","path","wfsgrz",{"d":"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5"}],["$","path","3ahymv",{"d":"M12 12v6"}],["$","path","15xj92",{"d":"m15 15-3-3-3 3"}],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900","children":"Lecture material and academic file policy"}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-[15px]","children":[["$","li","Teachers may upload lecture material only for courses and sessions currently allotted to them. One course-and-session upload applies to every linked class in an approved merged schedule so eligible students receive the same material.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Teachers may upload lecture material only for courses and sessions currently allotted to them. One course-and-session upload applies to every linked class in an approved merged schedule so eligible students receive the same material."}]]}],["$","li","Students may view and download lecture files only through their authenticated portal and only when their active course, program, semester, and session match the material. Sharing protected file links or Institute material outside the authorized class is prohibited.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Students may view and download lecture files only through their authenticated portal and only when their active course, program, semester, and session match the material. Sharing protected file links or Institute material outside the authorized class is prohibited."}]]}],["$","li","Teachers are responsible for the relevance, accuracy, ownership, and safety of uploaded content. Repeated lecture numbers for the same course and session are blocked, and deleted or expired material may become unavailable to students.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Teachers are responsible for the relevance, accuracy, ownership, and safety of uploaded content. Repeated lecture numbers for the same course and session are blocked, and deleted or expired material may become unavailable to students."}]]}],["$","li","Lecture files, outlines, assignments, quizzes, submissions, and related attachments may be retained for academic continuity, quality review, audit, dispute handling, backup, and recovery in accordance with Institute requirements.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Lecture files, outlines, assignments, quizzes, submissions, and related attachments may be retained for academic continuity, quality review, audit, dispute handling, backup, and recovery in accordance with Institute requirements."}]]}]]}]]}]
21:["$","article","Employee biometric attendance and shift policy",{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm sm:p-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-100 pb-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-red-50 text-[#6D0303]","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":22,"height":22,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-fingerprint-pattern","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","1nerag",{"d":"M12 10a2 2 0 0 0-2 2c0 1.02-.1 2.51-.26 4"}],["$","path","o46ks0",{"d":"M14 13.12c0 2.38 0 6.38-1 8.88"}],["$","path","ptglia",{"d":"M17.29 21.02c.12-.6.43-2.3.5-3.02"}],["$","path","ydlgp0",{"d":"M2 12a10 10 0 0 1 18-6"}],["$","path","1gqxmh",{"d":"M2 16h.01"}],["$","path","drycrb",{"d":"M21.8 16c.2-2 .131-5.354 0-6"}],["$","path","1tidbn",{"d":"M5 19.5C5.5 18 6 15 6 12a6 6 0 0 1 .34-2"}],["$","path","13wd9y",{"d":"M8.65 22c.21-.66.45-1.32.57-2"}],["$","path","1fr1j5",{"d":"M9 6.8a6 6 0 0 1 9 5.2v2"}],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900","children":"Employee biometric attendance and shift policy"}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-[15px]","children":[["$","li","Authorized Accounts staff may import attendance logs exported from approved biometric devices. A machine identifier must be linked to the correct employee or faculty record before punches can be attributed to that person.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Authorized Accounts staff may import attendance logs exported from approved biometric devices. A machine identifier must be linked to the correct employee or faculty record before punches can be attributed to that person."}]]}],["$","li","The earliest valid daily punch is treated as First In and the latest valid daily punch as Last Out. Shift start, shift end, late grace, checkout grace, official off-days, weekend rules, full-day duties, employee status, and session scope are used to calculate Present, Absent, Late, Early Checkout, Off, or Not Scheduled status.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"The earliest valid daily punch is treated as First In and the latest valid daily punch as Last Out. Shift start, shift end, late grace, checkout grace, official off-days, weekend rules, full-day duties, employee status, and session scope are used to calculate Present, Absent, Late, Early Checkout, Off, or Not Scheduled status."}]]}],["$","li","Duplicate punches and duplicate file rows are ignored where identified. Unmatched, invalid, imported, generated, corrected, and reverted records remain subject to operational logs so authorized staff can investigate the source and history of a calculation.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Duplicate punches and duplicate file rows are ignored where identified. Unmatched, invalid, imported, generated, corrected, and reverted records remain subject to operational logs so authorized staff can investigate the source and history of a calculation."}]]}],["$","li","Accounts coordinators may view only the attendance session assigned to their authorized role. Admin may manage employee links, shifts, official off-days, corrections, and safe import reversals. A legacy import without a valid rollback snapshot cannot be automatically reverted and must be reviewed by Admin.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":["$L27","$L28"]}],"$L29"]}]]}]
22:["$","article","Queries, chat and digital communication policy",{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm sm:p-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-100 pb-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-red-50 text-[#6D0303]","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":22,"height":22,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-message-square-text","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","18887p",{"d":"M22 17a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6.828a2 2 0 0 0-1.414.586l-2.202 2.202A.71.71 0 0 1 2 21.286V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"}],["$","path","1twpyw",{"d":"M7 11h10"}],["$","path","d9of3u",{"d":"M7 15h6"}],["$","path","af5zfr",{"d":"M7 7h8"}],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900","children":"Queries, chat and digital communication policy"}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-[15px]","children":[["$","li","Portal queries must be sent to the relevant department using an applicable reason. A student cannot open another active query for the same department until the previous query is Closed.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Portal queries must be sent to the relevant department using an applicable reason. A student cannot open another active query for the same department until the previous query is Closed."}]]}],["$","li","Course chat is limited to authorized teachers and students belonging to the linked schedule group. Delivery, read status, attachments, and sender deletion actions may be recorded to support reliable communication.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Course chat is limited to authorized teachers and students belonging to the linked schedule group. Delivery, read status, attachments, and sender deletion actions may be recorded to support reliable communication."}]]}],["$","li","Users must communicate respectfully and must not submit passwords, malicious files, harassment, confidential information unrelated to the case, or content that violates Institute policy.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Users must communicate respectfully and must not submit passwords, malicious files, harassment, confidential information unrelated to the case, or content that violates Institute policy."}]]}]]}]]}]
23:["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}]
24:["$","span",null,{"children":"Teacher leave does not automatically cancel a scheduled class. Until the affected class is formally cancelled, reassigned, marked off, or replaced by an approved make-up class, the original schedule and student-attendance responsibilities remain active."}]
25:["$","li","A teacher or authorized office must use the approved class-cancellation, reassignment, academic off-day, or make-up class workflow for every affected course and session. Informal messages or an external leave application alone do not change student schedules in EIMS LMS.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"A teacher or authorized office must use the approved class-cancellation, reassignment, academic off-day, or make-up class workflow for every affected course and session. Informal messages or an external leave application alone do not change student schedules in EIMS LMS."}]]}]
26:["$","li","For merged classes, any approved operational change must cover every linked program and batch schedule so all affected students receive the same class status. The responsible department should arrange continuity, substitution, cancellation, or make-up delivery according to Institute rules.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"For merged classes, any approved operational change must cover every linked program and batch schedule so all affected students receive the same class status. The responsible department should arrange continuity, substitution, cancellation, or make-up delivery according to Institute rules."}]]}]
27:["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}]
28:["$","span",null,{"children":"Accounts coordinators may view only the attendance session assigned to their authorized role. Admin may manage employee links, shifts, official off-days, corrections, and safe import reversals. A legacy import without a valid rollback snapshot cannot be automatically reverted and must be reviewed by Admin."}]
29:["$","li","Biometric attendance is an institutional employment record. Users must not manipulate machine identifiers, punch files, timestamps, shifts, or attendance outcomes. Suspected errors should be reported promptly to Accounts or Admin with supporting information.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#6D0303]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Biometric attendance is an institutional employment record. Users must not manipulate machine identifiers, punch files, timestamps, shifts, or attendance outcomes. Suspected errors should be reported promptly to Accounts or Admin with supporting information."}]]}]
